&lt;h2&gt;


Future Roadmap
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The project already has a solid foundation. Planned improvements include:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product reviews &amp;amp; ratings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wishlist&lt;/li&gt;
